      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T18:27:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The comment is true of the `vm_dtbo` as it is passed in as a byte slice, but not as far as I can see of `fdt`. The caller passes in an `\u0026mut Fdt`, so what\u0027s to stop it continuing to use it after `sanitize_device_tree` returns an error?",
      "parentUuid": "08e22edd_4a1d70c5",
      "revId": "1ef8e45255b7ea8cc512a18c58a7e5e6bf87b975",
